docs {
  Broadcasts a **signed** transaction to the network.

  Replace the body with the full transaction you built (e.g. via
  `CreateTransaction2` or `TriggerContract`) after signing it locally —
  `raw_data` exactly as returned, plus your signature(s) in `signature`.

  **Service:** `protocol.Wallet` · **Method:** `BroadcastTransaction` (unary)

  All `bytes` fields are sent as **base64 of the raw bytes** (protobuf JSON mapping).
  For a TRON address, base58-decode it (or take the 21-byte hex form starting with `41`)
  and base64-encode the raw bytes, e.g. `echo 41E552...32CD0 | xxd -r -p | base64`.
}
